    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The specialty type associated with the allergy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The offset when the allergy was entered.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The response to therapy for the infectious disease.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a care plan for infectious disease to a patient unit stay.</rdfs:comment>
